@user = admin
@password = password123

GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/admin/getUrl()
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}

### Rama de la línea 20 → devuelve url
GET http://localhost:4004/odata/v4/admin/getUrl(book='El valle de los lobos')
Authorization: Basic {{user}}:{{password}}

